{
    "title": "Bounce: Luggage Storage Nearby",
    "description": "Make your journey lighter with Bounce, the #1 global luggage storage network.\r\n\r\nBounce is the luggage storage network that's everywhere you are, whether you're around the globe or around the corner. We're here to keep your stuff safe so you're free for your next adventure.\r\n\r\nFreely explore anywhere you go\r\n- Find us in 86 countries around the world.\r\n- Our network is powered by 10,000+ trusted partners in 2,500+ cities.\r\n- Whether you're on vacation, on a work trip, or staying local, make the most of any place without worrying about your stuff.\r\n\r\nBook, drop, and explore in a tap\r\n- Find and book a convenient bag storage spot in 2 minutes.\r\n- Seamless QR-code system makes drop-off and pick-up fast and secure.\r\n- Share your booking details with friends or save them for offline access.\r\n\r\nStay flexible if plans change\r\n- Pay an affordable daily price for storage instead of by the hour.\r\n- Cancel your booking for free before your drop-off time.\r\n- Easily add bags, change your booking time, or cancel right from the app.\r\n\r\nSecure storage for your stuff\r\n- Our trusted partners keep your stuff safe in secure areas of their business.\r\n- Our partners are real people who keep an eye on your things.\r\n- In the unlikely event of theft, loss, or damage, your things are covered up to $10,000.\r\n\r\nKnow you're supported 24/7\r\n- Our dedicated luggage storage support team is always available to help, including nights and weekends.\r\n- Easily contact our support team or Bounce partner in the app.\r\n- No matter the question or concern, we're here to help.\r\n\r\nHow it works\r\n1. Book on the app\r\nDownload the app and choose a convenient luggage storage location.\r\n2. Head to the store\r\nShow your booking confirmation to the Bounce Partner and drop off your bags.\r\n3. Enjoy the day\r\nMake the most of your day, then show your confirmation to pick up your stuff.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Make your journey lighter with Bounce, the #1 global luggage storage network.<br><br>Bounce is the luggage storage network that&#39;s everywhere you are, whether you&#39;re around the globe or around the corner. We&#39;re here to keep your stuff safe so you&#39;re free for your next adventure.<br><br>Freely explore anywhere you go<br>- Find us in 86 countries around the world.<br>- Our network is powered by 10,000+ trusted partners in 2,500+ cities.<br>- Whether you&#39;re on vacation, on a work trip, or staying local, make the most of any place without worrying about your stuff.<br><br>Book, drop, and explore in a tap<br>- Find and book a convenient bag storage spot in 2 minutes.<br>- Seamless QR-code system makes drop-off and pick-up fast and secure.<br>- Share your booking details with friends or save them for offline access.<br><br>Stay flexible if plans change<br>- Pay an affordable daily price for storage instead of by the hour.<br>- Cancel your booking for free before your drop-off time.<br>- Easily add bags, change your booking time, or cancel right from the app.<br><br>Secure storage for your stuff<br>- Our trusted partners keep your stuff safe in secure areas of their business.<br>- Our partners are real people who keep an eye on your things.<br>- In the unlikely event of theft, loss, or damage, your things are covered up to $10,000.<br><br>Know you&#39;re supported 24/7<br>- Our dedicated luggage storage support team is always available to help, including nights and weekends.<br>- Easily contact our support team or Bounce partner in the app.<br>- No matter the question or concern, we&#39;re here to help.<br><br>How it works<br>1. Book on the app<br>Download the app and choose a convenient luggage storage location.<br>2. Head to the store<br>Show your booking confirmation to the Bounce Partner and drop off your bags.<br>3. Enjoy the day<br>Make the most of your day, then show your confirmation to pick up your stuff.",
